     "Favorite Antagonists",
     "I add to the list those villains and antagonists and evils who were negative in their true sense. Their reason, methods and everything comprised of purely evil and selfish meanings. And in the end, they still came out t be likable and enjoyable and made the franchise an amazing experience.",
