    [
     "Characters I hate",
     "First of all im not a hater, but there are some things with which you just cant make peace with. the anime universe is filled with characters that make us pissed and we wish they were not there but if that wish were to come true the story would not be able to move forward, in other words, those characters were necessary or their job was to make the viewers angry or feel hate towards them. villains or antagonists. but sometimes we face ourselves with characters which share personalities that were meant to bring joy or to make people side with them, heroes or protagonists. these people become the real problem when you can not come to side with them, they just become an eye sore. and you just wished that you dont have to do further with them but they keep on sprouting again and again since they are normally the main leads which gives you three situations. one : you hate the series as a whole sue to them since you start to dislike everything around these characters. two : you just feel its the worst part of your life when that certain characters come and the fun of the show gets lost but as soon as the character is taken off screen the love for others make the show worth while again. three : you hate them such that those negative feelings becomes your anchor for feeling more inclined and related to the story which is a good thing and I appreciate these characters for sucking so bad as for me to hate or dislike them.",
